    <string name="night_help">Visual comfort filter within NatjeTube. Warmth is a tint, not calibrated Kelvin or TV backlight control. Bright video highlights are dimmed uniformly; only bright interface text is softened separately. HDR, tunnelling and the decoder are kept. No verified pixel colour correction is enabled.</string>
    <string name="night_schedule_help">Manual changes in automatic mode last until the next scheduled switch. Equal start/end times mean no active interval. Solar times are calculated offline from your coordinates; polar day/night has no daily switch.</string>
